<p>You temporarily merge with your mucus, cleansing yourself of <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">2, 2, 3, 3, 3</acronym> physical or magical detrimental effects.</p><p>You can then reemerge on any tile within sight and range that is also covered by mucus.</p><p>This is quick, performed in only <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">100%, 82%, 66%, 56%, 48%</acronym> of the normal time, but you must be in contact with your mucus.</p>